    mutate::changed::tests::a_change_to_the_builds_settings_chooses_every_break

[break] changed-ignores-a-crates-build-script
rule: A change to the `Cargo.toml` or `build.rs` of a crate a break runs chooses the break.
file: xtask/src/mutate/changed.rs
in: touched_by
find: ["Cargo.toml", "build.rs"]
replace: ["build.rs"]
caught-by:
    mutate::changed::tests::a_change_to_the_builds_settings_chooses_every_break

[break] changed-reads-only-the-first-crate-of-a-break
rule: A test of any crate a break runs (`packages`) is one the diff may touch.
file: xtask/src/mutate/changed.rs
in: touched_by
find: packages.iter().map(|name| directory_of(name))
replace: packages.iter().take(1).map(|name| directory_of(name))
caught-by:
    mutate::changed::tests::the_packages_a_break_names_are_the_crates_it_is_judged_in

[break] changed-reads-a-test-by-its-whole-path
rule: A test is placed by the last segment of its name, since its module path is not a path of files.
file: xtask/src/mutate/changed.rs
in: placed
find: let last = name.rsplit("::").next().unwrap_or(name);
replace: let last = name;
caught-by:
    mutate::changed::tests::a_break_is_chosen_by_a_test_it_names_and_not_by_another

[break] changed-reads-the-binary-as-part-of-the-name
rule: The binary of a `caught-by` entry is not part of the test's name.
